# From Luke repo
historic/jazz_email_instructions_to_luke.md
# Mailing-list and RSVP exports. Real names and email addresses, and this
# repository is public — a stray `git add .` would publish every mourner's
# address. Downloaded from /admin, read with `npm run rsvp`, never committed.
/exports/

# Design working files for printed material. Large binaries that would sit in
# git history forever, and the kind of file that quietly carries embedded images
# or a recipient list. Back these up with the photo originals instead.
/invitation/
*.ai
